# Empty on purpose: production calls go through Vercel's own rewrites (see
# vercel.json), which proxy /api, /oauth2, /login, /logout to the Render
# backend server-to-server. That makes every request the browser makes
# same-origin to vercel.app, so the session cookie ends up scoped to
# vercel.app too — required because browsers now block third-party cookies
# by default, which broke sign-in when the API was called directly cross-site.
VITE_API_URL=
